][/dim]Keep a typed / literal after album routes and open the record list[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In Bob Mac Capture, typing `/` right after an album route such as [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@eat` inserts a literal `/` (the `@eat/` record route) instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the `/` → `#` capture alias, an explicit `#` still opens the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]section menu, and a draft that is only `@eat/` immediately lists [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that album's existing record notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]album_slash_record_list.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/album_slash_record_list.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mn[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mn/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-rewrite keeps / literal after album routes[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob_rewrite[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob_rewrite: teach capture-rewrite's / → # alias (and its typing-tip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]proof) to stay literal when the / is glued to a single-@ album route, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]via one more bounded album-head read; add Rust unit and CLI tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update docs/capture.md, the CLI help, and the capture-alias glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac Capture opens the record list on a bare @album/ draft[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_record_list[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob_rewrite[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_record_list: in bob-mac-capture, skip the cached route list when the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]caret's record_route span is the whole draft so bob's record_target rows[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]show; add real-bob fixtures, fake-bob cases, hosted tests, and docs; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify on macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mn","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mn.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-mn.1"},"source_run_id":"run-3b9358a6a0a2082ce78c1928ac65147d","started_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:26.272418+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"be05a81c9f606184283ec964f8890fb5970b782944c1d12a51028c9b42c389c0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"52220efbefeedf0ea75f0fdc286ac91f93cd082ec0edadb46594f53297ec389d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"2eef9fd54862649dd70363266edb52715cbd8ea87b65cce5c22de797e8763ff6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/meta.json","size_bytes":659},"prompt":{"digest":"c54e3650aeb681f6176e1d07d3018b5ffcc8b120fe1b2258db1493a9acdf021c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/prompt.md","size_bytes":7402},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"4b875fb99b99553efd2cbc46407afbd54610757af04b32aee68e13d60b39ec51","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":336},"state":{"digest":"e9812c34f45c8ca7e2b271b0e52b393481290aefbd4f8154646d3a18dbf07068","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mn.2--2/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200